Query:
--Description: 10)  Produce the complete table of week-2 retention rates for every
--              quick-play event type (no LIMIT), based on users whose first
--              quick-play occurred 1-15 Aug 2018.  Logic is identical to the
--              validated query #8, just without the LIMIT clause.
--              -----------------------------------------------------------------
--              • aug_events  – 1-15 Aug events (uniform 4-column projection).
--              • cohort      – first quick-play per user (rn = 1) and cohort_day.
